  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rehabilitation and training of women, youth and persons with disabilities and disabling conditions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The sub-program, Rehabilitation and Training of Women, Youth, and Persons with Disabilities and Disabling Health Conditions programme, is a comprehensive female-focused healthcare and education initiative focused on three key and interconnected outcomes: 

1)	Safe spaces for certified technical and vocational education and training for women and adolescent girls established (no investments in facilities will be necessary);
2)	The rehabilitation centres are set up to function as regional humanitarian hubs for specialised emergency response; and 
3)	The provision of quality services for persons with disabilities and disabling health conditions strengthened.</narrative>
  </description>
